## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Clock Burst (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Genius Wand
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Blood Wings over Holy Crystal when Use when late fights are decided by surviving the first dive after the umbrella combo lands.; Winter Crown over Holy Crystal when Use against Ling, Hayabusa, Saber, or any dive that can kill Kagura before she retrieves the umbrella.; Glowing Wand over Genius Wand when Use when your team lacks anti-heal into Estes, Floryn, Uranus, Ruby, or heavy shield drafts.
- Total cost: 11940 gold

Default ranked mid build that turns the Clock and Truncheon spike into reliable backline burst, then adds layered penetration for late magic defense.

### Frontline CDR Burn (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive, Holy Crystal
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Wilderness Blessing, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy has only one true frontline and early flat Magic Penetration can decide mid rotations.; Lightning Truncheon over Wishing Lantern when Use when enemy carries are the only targets that matter and your team already has tank damage.; Ice Queen Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when your team needs repeated umbrella slows to keep durable enemies inside follow-up damage.
- Total cost: 12050 gold

Cooldown and burn setup for long objective fights where Kagura needs more umbrella cycles, anti-sustain pressure, and current-HP damage.

### Anti-Dive Safety (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Lightning Truncheon, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy dive is damage-heavy but not crowd-control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude.; Genius Wand over Winter Crown when Use when the enemy cannot force Kagura's stasis and you need earlier Magic Defense shred.; Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when your front line consistently peels assassins and the final slot can stay pure damage.
- Total cost: 10960 gold

Defensive mid build for suppressive pick comps and assassin-heavy drafts where one saved combo matters more than maximum damage.

